  "body": "How about:\r\n\r\n> To string concatenate a list _list_ with an optional separator _separator_, run these steps:\r\n> 1. If _list_ is empty, then return the empty string.\r\n> 2. Assert: _list_ only contains strings.\r\n> 3. If _separator_ is not given, then set _separator_ to the empty string.\r\n> 4. Assert: _separator_ is a string.\r\n> 5. Return a string whose contents are _list_'s items, in order, separated from each other by _separator_.\r\n\r\nNeeded for https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/555 and HTML; possibly other places. (URL concatenates bytes as well, but we don't have generics so...)\r\n\r\ncc @Ms2ger\r\n  ",
